  "title": "LATAM Announces Launch of Equity Offering",
  "summary": "Santiago (Chile), February 9, 2026 - LATAM Airlines Group S.A. (“LATAM” or the “Company”), the leading passenger and cargo airline group in South America, today announced that one of its shareholders launched a public offering to sell 9,000,000 American Depositary Shares (the “ADSs”), each representing 2,000 common shares of LATAM. No shares are being sold by the Company, and LATAM will not receive any proceeds from the sale of ADSs by the selling shareholder. The last reported per ADS price of",
